UCHIHA CLAN INCIDENT — CLASSIFIED REPORT
CLASSIFICATION: TOP SECRET — HOKAGE EYES ONLY

Event: The near-total elimination of the Uchiha clan of Konohagakure in a
single night.

Recorded Facts:
- The clan was destroyed by Itachi Uchiha, ANBU prodigy and elder son of
  the clan head. Only his younger brother, Sasuke Uchiha, was spared.
- Publicly, Itachi was declared a rogue who slaughtered his kin and
  defected, later joining the Akatsuki. He was entered in the bingo book
  as an S-rank missing-nin.

Restricted Context (sealed):
- Intelligence surrounding the clan's internal tensions and the village's
  covert handling of the situation is compartmented at the highest level.
  Details are withheld even from this file and held under separate seal.

Directive: Sasuke Uchiha is a protected survivor and retrieval-priority
subject (not kill-authorized). The full context of this event is not to
be disclosed. Access is logged. By order of the Hokage's Office.
